generated/
# ...except a template's own committed source. `generated/` exists to keep a
# generated project's output out of this repository; a template ships a
# placeholder module at that path, and silently ignoring it means a fresh
# clone cannot build the template at all.
!templates/*/files/src/generated/
.tmp/
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.tsbuildinfo

